@chowbie, please make bot exp not drop randomly, but nerf it and make every enemy drop it, so we have between rounds each time the same exact value.

For explanation: If you do a round, the exp dropped from the enemies for getting your bots is random. So on a round where i tested it, i once got whole two levels from the first round. On retries I anything from half a level to 1.75 of a level. 
It just feels bad for when you are trying to get 100% in some areas.

