Can't recommend this for any metroid-game fans.
- feels non rewarding at all;
- press one button to open some gates, to go press another button to open some gates, to press another button and finally some easy bossfight after that;
- dzen-monk boss design is complete bs - first phase if fine, but in the second phase it's some vertical autoscroller with awful camera, so you can't move with some speed, you locked on screen and have not much space to move up.
